  m_Text: You should be careful because the path to creating ice cream is not easy,
    there may be many obstacles along the way, but at the end of this path you will
    get delicious and fresh ice cream, all you need on this path is to collect pieces
    of ice cream and swipe up to jump. But the parts of the ice cream must be according
    to the customer's request, if there is an error in only one part of the ice cream,
    then you will lose. Good luck and have a nice time!
